{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54189","headline":"[拟]送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 王铎","name":"[拟]送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诏许真人归旧隐，爲言海上忆孤峰。\n宸庭（《广卓异记》作「旒」）暂别期千岁，野服飘然出九重。\n华表尚迷丁令鹤，竹陂犹认葛仙龙。\n自怜弱羽尘埃重，於此（《广卓异记》作「云外」）无由蹑去踪。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷二，校以《广卓异记》卷三。\n《广卓异记》题下署：「门下侍郎王铎。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王铎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}